                            {
                                "example_id": "824a29d6-a5d2-49f3-acb1-6aa780d1acc3",
                                "sense_id": "1c19809f-3656-3aa5-9470-67e278c40cc1",
                                "text": "Repéré par tous les réseaux de foodistas depuis son lancement, en 2011, le Braisenville a imposé son décor, censé évoquer la palette chromatique du barbecue (lustres orange braise, briques noir charbon, sol ciment gris cendre), et un vrai concept culinaire.",
                                "translation": "Spotted by all the foodista networks since its launch in 2011, the Braisenville has imposed its decor, which is supposed to evoke the chromatic palette of the barbecue (ember-orange chandeliers, charcoal-black bricks, an ash-gray cement floor), and a real culinary concept.",
                                "english": "Spotted by all the foodista networks since its launch in 2011, the Braisenville has imposed its decor, which is supposed to evoke the chromatic palette of the barbecue (ember-orange chandeliers, charcoal-black bricks, an ash-gray cement floor), and a real culinary concept."
                            }
                        ]
